{"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"ED:","x":0.08641975260213007,"y":0.14389534868426745,"w":0.026748971939086902,"c":1},{"x":0.086419753272558145,"w":0.045267489751180015,"c":1,"t":"RUTH:","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.18604651140713568},{"y":0.2151162788489962,"w":0.026748971939086902,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.086419752775312511,"t":"ED:"},{"t":"RUTH:","x":0.086419753272558145,"y":0.25872093001178686,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.045267489751180015},{"y":0.31686046486643815,"w":0.026748971939086902,"t":"ED:","x":0.086419752790744611,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"w":0.041152264277140291,"h":0.0072674419910804255,"t":"RUTH.","y":0.36918604642815156,"x":0.08847736570093602,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.086419752649283713,"y":0.38226744168329851,"w":0.026748971939086916,"t":"ED:","c":1},{"w":0.043209877014160153,"y":0.4113372091672336,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"RUTH:","c":1,"x":0.08641975274806396},{"x":0.088477366367656907,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.024691357612609863,"y":0.46947674404836848,"t":"ED:"},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"RUTH:","x":0.088477365695521254,"y":0.52761627896844843,"w":0.041152264277140305,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"ED:","y":0.55668604639361807,"w":0.024691357612609863,"x":0.088477366367656907,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"h":0.012617711043610536,"t":"RUTH:","x":0.085651150603370904,"y":0.56922446709710117,"c":1,"w":0.046924788157145167},{"c":1,"w":0.024691357612609863,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.64389534872250298,"t":"ED.","x":0.08847736635830411},{"c":1,"x":0.088477366246006328,"t":"RUTH:","y":0.68604651143473216,"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"y":0.75726744163969384,"w":0.026748971939086902,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.086419752775312511,"t":"ED:","c":1},{"t":"RUTH:","w":0.045267489751180029,"x":0.086419752963916158,"y":0.80523255802266813,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"w":0.57818929036458333,"c":1,"t":"There was one on personality, which said that a twin is likely to be quite shy in","y":0.14244186035850992,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.1790123505981048},{"y":0.15694935204590332,"h":0.013250883392226021,"c":1,"t":"social situations because they always have their twin around to depend on for","x":0.17901234243804595,"w":0.57613169352213534},{"y":0.1845930235363884,"x":0.179012343979673,"c":1,"t":"My cousins were like that when they were small - they were only interested in","h":0.013081394460653373,"w":0.57613169352213545},{"x":0.17901233961907109,"w":0.59465021769205739,"t":"each other and found it hard to engage with other kids. They're fine now though.","h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.20053003555549886,"c":1},{"h":0.015777162724866844,"t":"Only children have had a really bad press - a lot of studies have branded them","x":0.18099690885085618,"y":0.21348188627951292,"w":0.58242838541666664,"c":1},{"w":0.5864197285970052,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.17901235782122862,"y":0.22965116268400321,"t":"as loners who think the world revolves around them because they've never had"},{"c":1,"y":0.242638397964974,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.17901235089226863,"w":0.25102879842122394,"t":"to fight for their parents' attention."},{"t":"That does seem a bit harsh. One category I hadn't considered before was","y":0.25641468282937407,"w":0.54743982950846348,"h":0.015256834535632535,"x":0.17896314286428358,"c":1},{"t":"children with much older siblings - a couple of studies mentioned that these","x":0.17901233615345177,"w":0.5617284138997396,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"y":0.27325581384668896},{"c":1,"t":"children grow up more quickly and are expected to do basic things for","x":0.18106995591742522,"w":0.51851852416992184,"y":0.28769140142451,"h":0.011778563015312216},{"y":0.30232558128601172,"x":0.17901234054923273,"t":"themselves - like getting dressed.","w":0.25514404296875004,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"y":0.31506213909087788,"x":0.17896002799132815,"t":"I can see how that might be true - although I expect they're sometimes the exact","h":0.014682564213082117,"c":1,"w":0.60093312581380209},{"c":1,"t":"opposite - playing the baby role and clamouring for special treatment.","x":0.1790123429023015,"w":0.51851852416992184,"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.32979976454378179},{"t":"What was the problem with most of these studies, do you think?","y":0.36627906963366685,"x":0.17695474433814784,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.47736623128255218,"c":1},{"x":0.17901234149303272,"h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1,"y":0.38074204924548716,"t":"I think it was because in a lot of cases data was collected from only one sibling","w":0.58230453491210943},{"c":1,"x":0.18106994932542875,"y":0.39534883708906787,"w":0.5617284138997396,"t":"per family, who rated him or herself and his or her siblings at the same time.","h":0.013081395583944833},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.56995885213216146,"y":0.40988372082343327,"t":"Mmm. Some of the old research into the relationship between birth order and","c":1,"x":0.17901234336897384},{"x":0.17901234149128906,"y":0.42432273275459209,"c":1,"w":0.58230453491210932,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"academic achievement has been proved to be accurate though. Performances"},{"h":0.014601130648411842,"x":0.17894780384093148,"t":"in intelligence tests decline slightly from the eldest child to his or her younger","w":0.57008580525716146,"c":1,"y":0.43763279642113206},{"x":0.17901234243587189,"w":0.40946502685546876,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"siblings. This has been proved in lots of recent studies.","y":0.4534746762559756},{"x":0.17894068732364493,"y":0.46654151145039102,"w":0.54952626546223948,"t":"Yes. Although what many of them didn't take into consideration was family","c":1,"h":0.015999638992147847},{"t":"size. The more siblings there are, the likelier the family is to have a low socio-","y":0.48255813942808445,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.17901234244136219,"w":0.57613169352213545},{"c":1,"x":0.17897262093231509,"t":"economic status - which can also account for differences between siblings in","h":0.013165464951657824,"y":0.49565643492263067,"w":0.57210316975911457},{"t":"academic performance.","y":0.51148409917238491,"x":0.17901234363671942,"w":0.17901234944661459,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"y":0.52465012675777989,"c":1,"t":"The oldest boy might be given more opportunities than his younger sisters, for","h":0.016042083677330066,"x":0.18102423801511699,"w":0.57829559326171875},{"y":0.54062610425364688,"c":1,"t":"example.","x":0.17898932381442895,"w":0.072062505086262996,"h":0.011771047073202534},{"x":0.17885051804518123,"t":"Exactly.","h":0.013837982824750128,"w":0.059994436899820952,"c":1,"y":0.55485426437479468},{"w":0.57818929036458333,"t":"But the main reason for the marginally higher academic performance of oldest","x":0.1810699637683256,"y":0.56976744175390381,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"x":0.18106994932585033,"y":0.58421672562257876,"w":0.5617284138997396,"h":0.011778563015312216,"t":"children is quite surprising, I think. It's not only that they benefit intellectually","c":1},{"t":"from extra attention at a young age - which is what I would have expected. It's","y":0.59738372115630112,"w":0.58436213175455731,"c":1,"x":0.17901235092656217,"h":0.013081394460653373},{"t":"that they benefit from being teachers for their younger siblings, by verbalising","x":0.17695472926390002,"h":0.013084819375836831,"w":0.57613169352213545,"y":0.61336866911136945,"c":1},{"w":0.078189303080240885,"y":0.62936046502612486,"x":0.18106995740771628,"c":1,"t":"processes.","h":0.008720930389296444},{"h":0.016059821008652997,"c":1,"x":0.18102318180813398,"t":"Right, and this gives them status and confidence, which again contribute, in a","w":0.57212519327799471,"y":0.6409113348640687},{"h":0.015458290091111326,"y":0.65508390366319291,"x":0.1788409209922098,"c":1,"w":0.24937543233235673,"t":"small way, to better performance."},{"w":0.47942387898763017,"x":0.17901234023780452,"y":0.67005813940112224,"h":0.014570836043610647,"t":"So would you say sibling rivalry has been a useful thing for you?","c":1},{"y":0.68459302312304926,"w":0.59876541137695316,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"I think so - my younger brother was incredibly annoying and we fought a lot but I","x":0.17901235653039596},{"y":0.69905771519161142,"w":0.59670781453450528,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"think this has made me a stronger person. I know how to defend myself. We had","x":0.17901234777389968},{"y":0.71366279097824892,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"x":0.17901235268032262,"t":"some terrible arguments and I would have died rather than apologise to him - but","w":0.60493825276692714},{"h":0.014555927721434658,"y":0.72674954970500161,"w":0.57828633626302084,"x":0.17897498650124627,"c":1,"t":"we had to put up with each other and most of the time we co-existed amicably"},{"y":0.74273255840288988,"t":"enough.","c":1,"h":0.011627906062437354,"w":0.063786004384358719,"x":0.18106996128518688},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.17901235059379975,"t":"Yes, my situation was pretty similar. But I don't think having two older brothers","y":0.7572674417271178,"c":1,"w":0.57818929036458333},{"c":1,"t":"made me any less selfish - I was never prepared to let my brothers use any of","w":0.58230453491210943,"x":0.18106995466747833,"y":0.77179034162815119,"h":0.01309337941721278},{"c":1,"h":0.011857843230554166,"w":0.082369009653727204,"t":"my stuff …..","y":0.78622224077889469,"x":0.17898010443304532},{"t":"That's perfectly normal, whereas ...","y":0.80137400744697185,"w":0.26387280782063799,"h":0.016663073931762584,"c":1,"x":0.18080031277810221},{"w":0.098840497334798161,"c":1,"t":"PART 4","y":0.84872070066441641,"x":0.088439833101394999,"h":0.016221389051601309},{"x":0.088477363639152179,"t":"Today I'm going to talk about the eucalyptus tree. This is a very common tree here in","y":0.87632508820666277,"w":0.62757202148437508,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.89098837197346925,"x":0.088477363325303218,"t":"Australia, where it's also sometimes called the gum tree. First I'm going to talk about why it's","w":0.68518519083658858,"c":1},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.90547703169403404,"w":0.53497940063476568,"t":"important, then I'm going to describe some problems it faces at present.","x":0.088477377747556429,"c":1},{"t":"Test 1","x":0.8127572007148397,"w":0.0576131693522135,"h":0.014534882858869391,"c":1,"y":0.097383721179576943},{"t":"Q24","x":0.81275720225568704,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.14244186032642436,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1},{"x":0.81275720232965365,"t":"Q25","y":0.22819767422837645,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"t":"Q26","y":0.28779069753572672,"x":0.81275720225568704,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"x":0.81275720225568704,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.4680232556752616,"t":"Q27"},{"t":"Q28","x":0.81481481527452393,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.59738372074727186,"w":0.034979422887166267,"c":1},{"t":"Q29\/Q30","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.69912790683937021,"c":1,"x":0.79218106990144821,"w":0.076131687164306627},{"x":0.79629629580095718,"c":1,"w":0.072016461690266875,"t":"Q29\/Q30","h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.72819767428123061},{"w":0.024691357612609877,"x":0.84567901255171973,"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.91715116251473339,"c":1,"t":"99"}],"w":2400}